      "text": "Microsize griseofulvin:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " adults 0.5 g daily (125 mg QID, 250 mg BID or 500 mg/day); children older than 2 years usually 10 mg/kg daily. Continue until the organism is eradicated."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
